{"title":"Titanium Axe","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Tool Smithing Lv 60)</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Tool Smithing at level 60 <span class=\"muted\">(4978 XP)</span> from 4× <a href=\"#/item/titanium-bar\">Titanium Bar</a>, 1× <a href=\"#/item/shagbark-wood\">Shagbark Wood</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/tool-smithing\">Tool smithing</a></p>\n      <h2>Quality</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quality\"><a class=\"q-chip q-all\" href=\"#/item/titanium-axe\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-inferior\" href=\"#/item/titanium-axe?q=inferior\">Inferior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-crude\" href=\"#/item/titanium-axe?q=crude\">Crude</a><a class=\"q-chip q-shoddy\" href=\"#/item/titanium-axe?q=shoddy\">Shoddy</a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/titanium-axe?q=ordinary\">Ordinary</a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/titanium-axe?q=good\">Good</a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/titanium-axe?q=excellent\">Excellent</a><a class=\"q-chip q-superior\" href=\"#/item/titanium-axe?q=superior\">Superior</a><a class=\"q-chip on q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/titanium-axe?q=flawless\">Flawless</a></div><div class=\"q-picker w-ench\" data-gear=\"titanium-axe\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Enchant\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip on\" data-wench=\"\">No enchant</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"artisan\">Artisan</button></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">Quality scales this item’s own stats. </p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\" id=\"gearQTable\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Quality</th><th>Stats</th><th>This item</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"gearQRows\"><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/titanium-axe?q=inferior\" title=\"Show it at Inferior\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-inferior\" src=\"da