e?q=flawless\" title=\"Show it at Flawless\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-flawless\" src=\"data/img/b8513b347f1916d58e21.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-flawless\">Flawless</span></td><td>+38%</td><td>+15.8% success</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <h2>Getting Flawless ones</h2>\n      <p><b>Crafting</b> (Tool Smithing 60): the higher above 60 you are, the better the odds, up to +30. <a href=\"#/calc-quality\" data-qe=\"titanium-axe\">Plan it on Quality &amp; enchanting</a></p>\n        <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table\"><thead><tr><th>Your level</th><th><span class=\"q-name q-inferior\">Inferior</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-crude\">Crude</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-shoddy\">Shoddy</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">Ordinary</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-good\">Good</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-excellent\">Excellent</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-superior\">Superior</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-flawless\">Flawless</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>60 <span class=\"muted\">(+0)</span></td><td>1.5%</td><td>4.0%</td><td>19.1%</td><td>56.2%</td><td>16.2%</td><td>2.9%</td><td>0.2%</td><td>~0%</td></tr><tr><td>65 <span class=\"muted\">(+5)</span></td><td>0.5%</td><td>2.4%</td><td>14.2%</td><td>55.7%</td><td>21.4%</td><td>5.1%</td><td>0.7%</td><td>~0%</td></tr><tr><td>70 <span class=\"muted\">(+10)</span></td><td>0.1%</td><td>1.2%</td><td>10.0%</td><td>52.7%</td><td>26.4%</td><td>7.8%</td><td>1.7%</td><td>~0%</td></tr><tr><td>75 <span class=\"muted\">(+15)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.4%</td><td>6.6%</td><td>47.5%</td><td>30.8%</td><td>11.1%</td><td>3.5%</td><td>0.1%</td></tr><tr><td>80 <span class=\"muted\">(+20)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.1%</td><td>3.9%</td><td>40.8%</td><td>33.7%</td><td>15.1%</td><td>5.9%</td><td>0.6%</td></tr><tr><td>83 <span class=\"muted\">(+23)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.0%</td><td>2.8%</td><td>36.3%</td><td>34.5%</td><td>17.5%</td><td>7.8%</td><td>1.2%</td></tr><tr><td>85 <span class=\"muted\">(+25)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.0%</td><td>2.0%</td><td>33.3%</td><td>35.0%</td><td>19.1%</td><td>9.0%</td><td>1.6%</td></tr><tr><td>90 <span class=\"muted\">(+30)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.8%</td><td>25.7%</td><td>34.7%</td><td>22.7%</td><td>12.8%</td><td>3.3%</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      <p><b>Monster drops</b>: ordinary monsters and chests give at most Excellent; elites give only Excellent, Superior or Flawless (official guide).</p>\n      <p class=\"muted\">No Flawless drops of it recorded yet.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p><b>A tool for</b> Lumberjack. Better metal and quality raise its bonus: see the skill guide’s tool box.</p><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Other materials</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/axe\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/b7c5d3219a9ac7f312e7.svg\" alt=\"\">Axe</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/silver-axe\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/f196a3eb36f5ac196d05.svg\" alt=\"\">Silver Axe</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/gold-axe\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/050b430fe7c8d4b7d06e.svg\" alt=\"\">Gold Axe</a></p><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/titanium-bar\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/1f1604dc88f4e382bd7e.svg\" alt=\"\">Titanium Bar</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/shagbark-wood\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/27dcfbce89f072519264.svg\" alt=\"\">Shagbark Wood</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic q-glow-flawless\"><img src=\"data/img/b8513b347f1916d58e21.svg\" alt=\"Titanium Axe\"><span id=\"gearEnchBadge\" class=\"wp-badge\"></span></div><h3>Titanium Axe <span class=\"q-name q-flawless\">(Flawless)</span></h3><table>\n      \n      <tr><th>Bonus</th><td id=\"gearDmg\">+15.8% success <span class=\"muted\">(Flawless)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Tool Smithing 60</td